{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lumenknight</strong> is a fast-paced <strong>roguelike arena-survival game</strong> where every battle tests your reflexes and strategy.<br>Face waves of enemies, dodge attacks, time your strikes, and prove your skill in intense arena combat!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135160/extras/9b563bc49e453d4faf7c2e4142b48260.poster.avif?t=1762501132\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135160/extras/9b563bc49e453d4faf7c2e4142b48260.webm?t=1762501132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135160/extras/9b563bc49e453d4faf7c2e4142b48260.mp4?t=1762501132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between each run, return to your <strong>home base</strong> to prepare for the next challenge.<br>Unlock and equip <strong>different melee weapons</strong>, <strong>crossbows</strong>, <strong>spells</strong>, and <strong>buffs</strong> to create your own <strong>unique build</strong> before heading back into battle.<br>Every combination offers a new way to play experiment, adapt, and find the setup that fits your style!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135160/extras/9e7d2d4723fab5f387f6f61dc7e4ab89.poster.avif?t=1762501132\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135160/extras/9e7d2d4723fab5f387f6f61dc7e4ab89.webm?t=1762501132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135160/extras/9e7d2d4723fab5f387f6f61dc7e4ab89.mp4?t=1762501132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each arena ends with a <strong>powerful boss fight</strong> that rewards focus and timing.<br>Learn enemy patterns, master your moves, and push your limits to survive as long as you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to fight, improve, and rise stronger with every run?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135160/extras/5a344c3e5d6f9816050e16223760285b.poster.avif?t=1762501132\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135160/extras/5a344c3e5d6f9816050e16223760285b.webm?t=1762501132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135160/extras/5a344c3e5d6f9816050e16223760285b.mp4?t=1762501132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4135160?t=1762501132","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4135160?t=1762501132","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135160/7dc6608e271b168efb0219d1729788ab3f33fe01/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762501132","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135160/7dc6608e271b168efb0219d1729788ab3f33fe01/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762501132","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lumenknight</strong> is a fast-paced <strong>roguelike arena-survival game</strong> where every battle tests your reflexes and strategy.<br>Face waves of enemies, dodge attacks, time your strikes, and prove your skill in intense arena combat!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\